sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Programmer
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    Note over P,UI: Requires UC-02: a wayside is selected.
    opt start from an empty file
        P->>UI: click New
        UI->>S: newFile()
        S->>S: newFile internal: buffer := empty, file := gtc01_new.plc, clear the last RUN
        S-->>UI: emit bufferChanged, terminalChanged
    end
    loop each edit
        P->>UI: type in the editor
        UI->>S: setBuffer(text)
        S->>S: setBuffer internal: buffer := text, so the last RUN no longer matches
        S-->>UI: emit bufferChanged (canCommit false)
    end
    Note right of S: Nothing reaches the wayside until the buffer is run and committed.
